### TempMail OTP API — run with the VS Code REST Client or Visual Studio / Rider HTTP client.
### 1) Generate an inbox, 2) copy inboxId and accessToken into the variables below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@inboxId = paste-inbox-id-here
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Provider info (shows whether demo mode is active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/provider

### Generate a temporary inbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/generate

### Status (address, expiration, sync state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}/status
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}

### Messages (syncs with the provider when stale)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}/messages
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}

### Force refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}/refresh
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}

### Latest OTP and history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}/otp
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}

### Demo mode only: add a simulated verification email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}/demo/simulate-otp
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}

### Delete the inbox
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/temp-mail/{{inboxId}}
X-Inbox-Token: {{token}}
